  "intro_html": "<p>The second half of the normal approach to the Monte Rosa hut SAC is not a normal alpine hike, but a glacier tour: crampons, harness, rope and ice axe are essential. The approach is well marked white-blue-white, bars are placed on the glacier. With glacier shrinkage, the transition to the glacier and the route over it varies from year to year.\nIn summer 2019 a new route, the \"Panoramaweg Monte Rosa Hütte\", was added, which is about quarter an hour shorter than the old way.</p>",
